r print.png", "id": "246912787875696", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031311_246912791209029_5540108180063733703_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=BK6mGOktbWoQ7kNvwGSwXwN&_nc_oc=AdqXHUMkvDvLE_c-x-FYvbQD0ku0kuahuylaWap7HbKFqQznmvvXzB9L1jaP94LdL2g&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af4X2KHZ-bMfWypZy-duBxA-ev8ChV_h1mrU5mKHiL4VMw&oe=6A07306E"}, {"file_name": "Print 3.png", "id": "2170405556482566", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57572950_2170405559815899_5420058398011207589_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=tMfj2O0Y0ssQ7kNvwEN9_0I&_nc_oc=AdqHNKRctnWFDEPnOGUdIc9yruYyzHlANExP0URzBU407YrhWrk8SA-g_xC8aH0r1fU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af6hSXk3tY47NepjuQ_ECfgdkrv10nflD9JHz4YWFefLpg&oe=6A07422F"}, {"file_name": "Print 5.png", "id": "921050275807580", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974548_921050279140913_846272164452751718_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=pW7nv7tiYhMQ7kNvwEQSScJ&_nc_oc=AdpE7K9v-xWfSteIkO7pWFZBH9jB4ee-xk952QC8N2HhqbqXxjJzo_FMPB9_cVTdUSs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af5GfXZG2Ke8jloWbY2Y-SWCL2N5C0DrFfgtZiZSdgmw6g&oe=6A073517"}, {"file_name": "Print 2.png", "id": "1288706015050300", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75641339_1288706018383633_3836298053771559642_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=BBmhU3zT4WsQ7kNvwGDDayj&_nc_oc=AdpV8K19fcGx-0jEtvEMRw-vAKl1RrEyXJ8Qm2BOFjTT_lPWW3b_HPX44yf4xw-yZsQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af4d1QUYI-bqfeS1gGXZ2sgpgWABpW0EeV0ARn4qNVkuew&oe=6A073ED1"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Final v.0.1 (eeve).png", "id": "945385240225978", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974721_945385243559311_50820886768660782_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=oWyMoDuTrw8Q7kNvwEHpOW0&_nc_oc=Adr3GkN8IGSlNMP6tBNXMtyQCfSWtZz_FpL1Wvir_njxPwZauKPC1GoJzsR0jcQbqWs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af5_-kLaKrtJW3wl8tgIc_THiSYLp0e8LskbGK0MUyV-hw&oe=6A070C3C"}, "display_name": "My Room", "keywords": [], "long_description": "My Room is the game experience that allows you to interact with your friends and also create your own world.\n\nCustomize your character and explore our two game modes: Playground & My Room.\n\nIn the Playground you will find yourself in a multiplayer environment surrounded by minigames that are available to play with others. These games include:\n- Soccer: score as many goals as you can\n- Air Hockey (Arcade): play with the AI or with another player\n- Basketball (Arcade): throw the balls and try to score points\n- Cornhole (Arcade): have fun trying to score as you play with the bean bags\n- Darts (Arcade): practice your aiming in the available stations\n- Mini Golf (Arcade): try to aim the hole at the mini golf courses\nThe multiplayer also includes voice/text chat for you to communicate with other players\n\nWhen in My Room, you will be able to customize your own space. You can choose between 3 different themed templates, explore and change it the way you prefer.\n\n* Find more information about the gameplay itself the app*\n\nUpcoming updates in the near future:\n- Game monetary system\n- Shop\n- More games\n- More rooms\n\nHave fun!", "short_description": "Play minigames along with your friends in a multiplayer environment or explore and customize your own room with this experience."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://vresearchlab.com/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://vresearchlab.com/terms-of-use/", "publisher_name": "VResearch Lab", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://vresearchlab.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": null, "context_topics": [], "ex